{if:ADVANCED_TOOLTIP}{c_label}Lucky Hit Chance: {/c}{c_resource}[{Combat_Effect_Chance_Script_Formula_Override:20}|1%|]{/c}
{/if}Summon a {c_number}{SF_3}{/c}-headed hydra for {c_number}[{SF_0}|1|]{/c} seconds. Each head spits fire at enemies, dealing {c_number}{payload:TOOLTIP_DAMAGE}{/c} damage.

You may have up to {c_number}[SF_8]{/c} {c_important}Hydras{/c} active at a time.
